Z||000000||Lynx||10-19-2000||04:04 AM||||I havent been here fir a while because i sold my 85 sc for a 87 Iroc well i have now bought a 94 Z28 and dont need 2 camaro's well i loved my Fiero so im selling the Iroc and getting a Fiero again. I want a V6 this time for sure. Now what i want to know is what kind of milage can i excpect from a V6. Theres a 86 SE 2m6 for sale but its a auto what gets better gas the auto or the 4speed? Its only $1500 and it has 130000 and its in Great shape. There is also a 87Gt for sale its a auto same mileage but a fastback window is cracked and the paint has been subjected to arizone weather and its only $1800. So i whats the best combo for gas and speed.<P>Lynx<P>P.S. The car will run 75% highway miles driving to work and back.||||reg||1
